1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,612
Have you ever felt you were going to die?

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,940
I don't remember how long ago
it was, but there was one time.

3
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:16,317
It was during a fight with the last general
of the Dark Knights, or the one before.

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,812
Didn't think I'd make it out of that one.

5
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,500
You did, though.

6
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,177
Eventually you brought
his head back to me.

7
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,440
You felt it then, never again?

8
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:27,710
Hmm.

9
00:00:27,793 --> 00:00:29,300
If I did, I don't remember.

10
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,180
Why are you asking?

11
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:34,714
I tell someone like you worries
about dying, am I right?

12
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,440
Not true, my dear Bercouli.

13
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:41,940
I feel death hovering
over me every single day.

14
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:47,040
It is there in my dreams and
in the morning when I awaken.

15
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:48,830
Why?

16
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:52,320
Because I still do not control everything.

17
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:55,300
Because I still have enemies who live.

18
00:00:55,440 --> 00:01:00,280
And because the longer I live, it is
possible that at some point in the future,

19
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:02,320
there will come a new enemy.

20
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:05,380
Point taken, my lady.

21
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:10,340
I guess being the Pontifex
ain't easy after all, huh?

22
00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:19,060
Your Eminence?

23
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:23,240
I didn't get what you
meant then, but I do now.

24
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:31,117
No I

25
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:35,777
don't can't

26
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:36,737
The way that

27
00:01:36,820 --> 00:01:43,617
I want love I

28
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:46,957
pray that I hope

29
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:53,500
thatthe love Every day she
struggles with pain I don't know

30
00:02:40,220 --> 00:02:41,537
Thank

31
00:02:41,620 --> 00:02:42,937
you

32
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:50,020
so

33
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,499
much for watching.

34
00:03:17,740 --> 00:03:22,000
I have to say, you're looking much
healthier this morning, Kirito.

35
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:25,971
And your appetite's back with a vengeance.

36
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:31,104
Perhaps spending the night with
four lovely ladies is the reason.

37
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,160
I'll be damned.

38
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:50,920
It looks like Emperor Vecta's
got some bold strategies in mind.

39
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:54,460
He's taking a risk, and
it's gonna cost him big.

40
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:05,500
This is war, folks.

41
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:09,899
I want to remind you, this
ain't the time for mercy.

42
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:13,520
The enemy's making their way
across that canyon Asuna made.

43
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:17,520
This is our chance to
stop him. Chance? Yeah.

44
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:47,060
I want you to cast some ropes over to the
other side and send your people across.

45
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:49,080
If they fall, they fall.

46
00:04:51,380 --> 00:04:53,580
Execute anyone who doesn't comply.

47
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:55,840
What the hell?

48
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:59,937
The five tribes should be
conquering the human empire.

49
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:02,540
Not chasing after some priestess of light.

50
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:04,781
We're out here dying for nothing.

51
00:05:05,300 --> 00:05:07,320
Come on, come on, move it.

52
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:09,211
Get across while you can.

53
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:11,144
Hurry before the enemy notices.

54
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:37,760
Look out!

55
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,941
The Integrity Knights are coming!

56
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:42,944
Reject the ropes till the
rest of us get across!

57
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:57,040
Stop it!

58
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:06,570
This...

59
00:06:06,653 --> 00:06:08,540
This ain't no war.

60
00:06:08,940 --> 00:06:11,060
They can't even defend themselves.

61
00:06:11,740 --> 00:06:13,980
My people trained for this?

62
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:18,360
To shimmy across a rope and
die for no reason at all?

63
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:23,380
Forgive me.

64
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:26,180
Forgive me.

65
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,880
Forgive me.

66
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,520
No doubt about it.

67
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:36,840
The Human Empire's AIs are slightly
superior to the dark territories.

68
00:06:37,580 --> 00:06:38,460
Well done.

69
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:42,869
As far as adaptability goes,
they're on a whole other level.

70
00:06:43,860 --> 00:06:44,978
You're up, Critter.

71
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:46,860
Don't blow it.

72
00:06:52,500 --> 00:06:57,380
And for my next trick, syncing the
Underworld's time to the real world.

73
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:07,650
What?

74
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,360
No way!

75
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,100
Is this for real?

76
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:12,700
Are they crazy?

77
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:16,797
A PvP with lifelike human
avatars and realistic violence?

78
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:19,937
Do you mean we can, like, cut
off arms and heads and stuff?

79
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:20,850
No way!

80
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,981
No restrictions?

81
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:23,360
Hell to the yes!

82
00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:25,177
This developer's adventurous!

83
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:26,220
Yeah, baby!

84
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:28,361
I am so signing up for this beta!

85
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:32,837
Don't push, there's enough Dark
Knight accounts for everyone.

86
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:36,460
Go forth, my dudes, and chop
that human army to ribbons.

87
00:07:49,100 --> 00:07:50,217
Daddy! Mommy!

88
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:52,880
I have to do something. But what?

89
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:10,020
Xenob, it's Yui!

90
00:08:11,260 --> 00:08:12,090
Yui?

91
00:08:12,173 --> 00:08:13,003
What are you doing?

92
00:08:13,086 --> 00:08:15,157
I'm sorry to call so late,
but it's an emergency.

93
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,070
Get dressed.

94
00:08:16,153 --> 00:08:17,437
There's a taxi waiting out, Brent.

95
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:19,997
I sent the address in the
fastest route to your phone.

96
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,277
Make sure to follow it.

97
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,257
What's going on?

98
00:08:22,340 --> 00:08:23,340
Where am I going?

99
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:25,277
Daddy and Mommy are in danger.

100
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,772
I'll explain on the way.

101
00:08:29,220 --> 00:08:32,380
Driver, take me to Minato
Ward in Tokyo, please.

102
00:08:34,620 --> 00:08:36,855
Sorry I left without telling you, Mom.

103
00:08:37,040 --> 00:08:39,393
But Kazuto's in trouble and he needs me.

104
00:08:56,960 --> 00:09:00,431
It's been ten hours since Asuna
logged into the underworld.

105
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:02,720
So in there, it's been a year.

106
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:04,780
What's taking her so long?

107
00:09:08,460 --> 00:09:11,557
The world's end altar can't
be that far away from her.

108
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,260
Or can it?

109
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:15,470
Hey!

110
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:16,700
Geeks, the phone!

111
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:20,060
Kikuoka and Subcon, talk to me.

112
00:09:20,460 --> 00:09:21,300
Hello, sir.

113
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:24,913
I know I'm not supposed to
call HQ unless it's important.

114
00:09:25,780 --> 00:09:28,100
This is Hiroki at Rathropongi.

115
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:29,957
We've got an issue here.

116
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:32,020
I think it's some kind of prank.

117
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:36,575
A couple visitors just showed up at
our location without an appointment.

118
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:37,910
Visitors?

119
00:09:37,993 --> 00:09:39,060
Who are they? Clients?

120
00:09:39,260 --> 00:09:43,620
No, they're definitely not clients,
but they seem to know a lot about us.

121
00:09:44,300 --> 00:09:45,130
They're girls.

122
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,560
Two teenage girls.

123
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,550
What?

124
00:09:48,633 --> 00:09:50,080
Teenagers, you said? Yeah.

125
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:55,191
Anyway, they knew your name and that
you were at Wrath HQ, so I let them in.

126
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:59,617
They said I should call you and ask you
to check the FLA rate of the underworld.

127
00:09:59,700 --> 00:10:01,112
They said it was urgent.

128
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,670
Holy!

129
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:06,740
It's one-to-one?

130
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:07,960
Since when?

131
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:11,224
Hey, Hiroki, did the girls
tell you their names?

132
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:14,558
Yes, sir, but the names they
gave are obviously fake.

133
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:17,802
They said not to worry,
you'd know who they were.

134
00:10:17,920 --> 00:10:19,740
Hold on, I wrote them down.

135
00:10:20,060 --> 00:10:23,960
Let's see, one called herself
Sinon, and the other Leafa.

136
00:10:24,460 --> 00:10:27,872
It sounds crazy, but that's
what they told me to tell you.

137
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:40,540
I swear, he's in a coma and he still
managed to get caught up in something crazy.

138
00:10:41,460 --> 00:10:47,480
I mean, a full-on AI called Alice who was
born in a virtual world made by the SDF?

139
00:10:48,180 --> 00:10:51,820
This is way beyond VR games,
and there's no going back.

140
00:10:52,300 --> 00:10:53,320
Poor Alice.

141
00:10:53,580 --> 00:10:56,837
She's so special, and they just
want her to fly fighter jets.

142
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:59,520
Ultimately, yes, but
they won't right away.

143
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:04,297
Wrath will probably use her to demonstrate
the technology to the world first.

144
00:11:04,380 --> 00:11:08,877
The hijackers aboard the ocean turtle,
however, aren't interested in demonstrations.

145
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:13,019
I think once they get her, they'll
use her for what she was intended.

146
00:11:13,500 --> 00:11:15,297
Know anything else about those creeps?

147
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:17,137
Like who they are or where they're from?

148
00:11:17,220 --> 00:11:21,260
I can't confirm it, but
I think they're U .S.

149
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:22,871
military or intelligence.

150
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:24,350
What?

151
00:11:24,433 --> 00:11:25,263
They're behind it?

152
00:11:25,346 --> 00:11:26,320
Oh my god.

153
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:29,981
Again, I can't confirm
they're involved with this.

154
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:34,240
But if they are, and Alice
does fall into their hands,

155
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:36,480
they'll use her for drone warfare.

156
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:40,840
I know Daddy and Mommy wouldn't
want that to happen to her.

157
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:42,997
Because Alice...

158
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,560
Alice is proof.

159
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:49,340
Her existence proves all VR
worlds starting with SAO are real.

160
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:52,128
That those who lived
in them had real lives.

161
00:11:52,260 --> 00:11:54,777
She's the result of massive
amounts of the time,

162
00:11:54,860 --> 00:11:57,625
energy, and imagination
of thousands of humans.

163
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:06,717
I'm convinced, beyond a doubt, she's
why the seed package was created.

164
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:11,897
Its true purpose, to give
birth to someone like her.

165
00:12:11,980 --> 00:12:15,697
Throughout all the connected worlds
that sprang up from the seed.

166
00:12:15,780 --> 00:12:19,637
So many people have laughed,
cried, suffered and loved.

167
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:22,937
It was the radiance of all those
souls shimmering with life.

168
00:12:23,020 --> 00:12:27,608
That made it possible for a new form of
humanity to be born in the underworld?

169
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:34,500
Daddy and Mommy, Leafa, Klein,
Lisbeth, Silica, Egil and Xenon.

170
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:38,017
It's the combination of your
hearts and so many others,

171
00:12:38,100 --> 00:12:41,747
all woven together in a big
tapestry that gave birth to Alice.

172
00:12:45,180 --> 00:12:47,037
Yeah, you're right.

173
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:49,100
It's all connected. People.

174
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,540
And time.

175
00:12:50,780 --> 00:12:51,960
And our hearts, too.

176
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,791
Flowing like a big river.

177
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:59,697
It's okay, Iui. Don't cry.

178
00:12:59,780 --> 00:13:01,577
We'll rescue Kirito and Asuna.

179
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:05,277
I promise, we'll do whatever it
takes to get them out of this.

180
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,760
You can count on that.

181
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:08,160
Damn straight.

182
00:13:08,460 --> 00:13:10,177
You should have come to us sooner.

183
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:13,197
If there's a chance to get him
out, hell, we're taking it.

184
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:14,480
You got that right.

185
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:16,347
I owe him as much as anyone.

186
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:18,991
About damn time I started paying him back.

187
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:23,397
You guys, thank you so much.

188
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:25,140
Seriously, thank you.

189
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:26,530
Mm-hmm.

190
00:13:27,580 --> 00:13:28,639
Now the hard part.

191
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:34,220
There's 30,000 American VR MMO players
diving, and soon it could go up to 100 thou.

192
00:13:34,940 --> 00:13:37,657
The Human Army's just a
bunch of targets to them.

193
00:13:37,740 --> 00:13:40,417
What's stopping us from
doing what the Hijackers did?

194
00:13:40,500 --> 00:13:43,520
We can post on the same
US VR MMO sites, too.

195
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:47,477
We'll tell the players about the
experiment and the fake beta.

196
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:49,277
I'm pretty sure they'll listen.

197
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:51,177
At the center of it
all is the struggle for

198
00:13:51,260 --> 00:13:53,789
military secrets between
Japan and America.

199
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:57,569
If we told anyone about that,
it would just make this worse.

200
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:02,117
If we said they'd be killing real
people, not avatars, maybe...

201
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,480
Oh, who am I kidding?

202
00:14:05,180 --> 00:14:08,440
Well, I say we tear a page
out of their playbook.

203
00:14:08,660 --> 00:14:11,057
We'll post a notice for
the beta test ourselves.

204
00:14:11,140 --> 00:14:13,846
Then we get the RAF guys
to hand out accounts,

205
00:14:13,940 --> 00:14:17,020
and I bet we could get 30
or 40,000 logged on easy.

206
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:20,801
That's a great idea, man,
but there's one problem.

207
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:23,600
You gonna tell me what that is? The time.

208
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:26,780
Here in Japan, it's 4.30 in the morning.

209
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:30,377
Besides us, there's not a
whole lot of folks online.

210
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:36,137
But in Los Angeles, it's half past noon
right now, and 3.30 in New York. The U .S.

211
00:14:36,220 --> 00:14:38,279
has way more active players online.

212
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:42,297
Agil is correct about that.

213
00:14:42,380 --> 00:14:45,317
We couldn't get the number
of players we need right now.

214
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:47,460
It would be way less than 10,000.

215
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:52,580
Our accounts would be the same level as
the Americans, so we'd be evenly matched.

216
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:55,157
Fighting all of them
off would be impossible.

217
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:59,475
But, like, maybe Wrath has more god
accounts like the one Asuna's using.

218
00:14:59,860 --> 00:15:01,437
We can't start from scratch.

219
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:04,579
We'd need as much time as
Kirito to level up enough.

220
00:15:05,260 --> 00:15:06,090
Crap.

221
00:15:06,173 --> 00:15:07,003
Game over, then.

222
00:15:08,060 --> 00:15:08,890
No.

223
00:15:08,973 --> 00:15:13,600
There are strong accounts, both in
terms of level and in equipment.

224
00:15:14,020 --> 00:15:16,780
The Americans' default
accounts can't compare.

225
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:18,710
Really?

226
00:15:18,793 --> 00:15:19,623
How do we get them?

227
00:15:19,706 --> 00:15:20,857
That's the best part.

228
00:15:20,940 --> 00:15:22,457
The accounts are already yours.

229
00:15:22,540 --> 00:15:24,437
They're the ones you're
locked in with now.

230
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:25,350
Huh?

231
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:27,320
You must convert them.

232
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:28,600
If you do,

233
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:32,157
then you and all the other
VR MMO players you recruit

234
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:34,897
will start with stronger
accounts than the Americans.

235
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:36,800
You're all leveled up already.

236
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:39,180
Just convert and log in. Of course.

237
00:15:39,380 --> 00:15:41,177
Why didn't any of us think of that?

238
00:15:41,260 --> 00:15:45,460
Although, I should mention,
this plan involves some risk.

239
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:54,378
What I'm about to tell you
is not some kind of prank.

240
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:57,357
There's a place called the Underworld.

241
00:15:57,440 --> 00:16:01,499
It's a virtual world based on the
seed, made by Japanese researchers.

242
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:06,817
As I stand here, tens of thousands of
American players are logging into it.

243
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:09,277
They've been told it's a beta
for a hack and slash game,

244
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:11,831
and they can kill anyone they come across.

245
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:14,637
But the people of the Underworld are real.

246
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:16,200
They're not just NPCs.

247
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:20,200
They're true bottom-up AIs, with
feelings and souls, like us.

248
00:16:20,460 --> 00:16:24,357
We need your help to protect them,
but there's no time to level up there.

249
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:27,137
But if you convert your character
accounts to the Underworld,

250
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:28,720
we can save their people!

251
00:16:33,700 --> 00:16:36,720
I know you well, and I
trust your intentions.

252
00:16:36,900 --> 00:16:40,937
You wouldn't have called us so early
just so you could play a trick on us.

253
00:16:41,020 --> 00:16:44,057
And the fact Kirito hasn't
logged on for over ten

254
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:47,960
days suggests whatever is
going on is indeed serious.

255
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:51,080
But AIs with human souls?

256
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:52,480
And the U .S.

257
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:54,228
military out to steal them?

258
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:56,500
It all seems so far-fetched.

259
00:16:57,760 --> 00:17:00,397
Diving in would be the
only way to confirm it.

260
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:03,900
In private, you told me
you had other concerns.

261
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:06,906
That converting our
accounts would have risks.

262
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:10,540
You should explain what
those are before we decide.

263
00:17:12,660 --> 00:17:13,490
Sure.

264
00:17:13,573 --> 00:17:14,420
Here's what I know.

265
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:20,480
The Underworld isn't a VR MMO game,
it's a simulated civilization.

266
00:17:20,860 --> 00:17:24,036
So you'll be faced with a
few issues once you dive in.

267
00:17:24,900 --> 00:17:29,640
The first one is, there's no user
interface to call up and manipulate.

268
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:33,341
Once you're logged in, you
can't log yourself out.

269
00:17:34,940 --> 00:17:38,360
The only way for you to log
out is by dying in there.

270
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:42,791
That brings me to another issue
you all need to know about.

271
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:46,800
The Underworld doesn't have
a pain absorber function.

272
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:50,861
If you take enough damage
to drop your HP to zero,

273
00:17:51,100 --> 00:17:53,453
you'll experience loads of virtual pain.

274
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:56,360
And finally,

275
00:17:56,680 --> 00:18:02,060
the Underworld's in a chaotic state right
now, and the devs can't fully operate it.

276
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:06,352
So once you convert your
character data to the Underworld,

277
00:18:06,580 --> 00:18:09,497
there's no guarantee you'll
be able to convert it back.

278
00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:10,410
And worse,

279
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:15,188
if you die there, there's a good chance
you might lose your character forever.

280
00:18:15,420 --> 00:18:16,250
Did I hear?

281
00:18:16,333 --> 00:18:17,357
How can she ask that?

282
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,270
Heart pass.

283
00:18:18,353 --> 00:18:19,693
Yeah, what's the point?

284
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:21,320
What a load of crap!

285
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:25,897
If we help them lose our characters,
are you gonna reimburse us for them?

286
00:18:25,980 --> 00:18:30,160
Or is this a trick to weaken the
tribe so you can take over? Hey!

287
00:18:30,700 --> 00:18:31,580
You're wrong.

288
00:18:31,940 --> 00:18:33,400
We're not tricking you.

289
00:18:34,740 --> 00:18:37,597
We know how hard you work
to build your characters up,

290
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:40,386
and no amount of money
can replace their loss.

291
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:42,825
We're not asking this lightly.

292
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,786
We're begging you to help us.

293
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,070
Right now,

294
00:18:46,153 --> 00:18:49,657
our friends are fighting the American
players alongside the Underworld,

295
00:18:49,740 --> 00:18:52,457
but they're outnumbered and
they need reinforcements.

296
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:56,477
You're all SAO survivors, so you
should be tough enough to deal with it!

297
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:59,557
screw your sob story you
think you're all that

298
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,717
just because you're in
that game here's your

299
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:04,517
chance to prove how
badass you are why should

300
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:07,117
we care about hijackers
or a .i's With souls,

301
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:10,717
don't bring this real life crap
into our game and expect us

302
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:14,297
to help you and the rest Of
your SAO club can deal with it?

303
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:15,877
Go save the day again!

304
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,380
You stuck up jerks!

305
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:25,200
It didn't work.

306
00:19:25,960 --> 00:19:27,497
No matter what I say!

307
00:19:27,580 --> 00:19:29,080
I don't care.

308
00:20:00,300 --> 00:20:02,940
You're right, this is a real-life problem.

309
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:06,360
And as for us survivors?

310
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,837
Yes, some of us do blur the line!

311
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:11,214
between the real world and the virtual.

312
00:20:11,700 --> 00:20:15,280
But we don't think we're tougher
or better than anyone here.

313
00:20:15,560 --> 00:20:17,325
None of us think we're heroes.

314
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:22,400
Me and Silica, she and I go to
a special school for survivors.

315
00:20:23,140 --> 00:20:23,970
Once a month,

316
00:20:24,053 --> 00:20:28,267
the students have to go to counseling
because of the trauma we still deal with.

317
00:20:28,760 --> 00:20:30,840
They ask us painful questions.

318
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:35,817
They make some of the kids take
medication, even though it makes them sick.

319
00:20:35,900 --> 00:20:37,018
And the government,

320
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:41,574
they're afraid of us, so they monitor
us like we're a bunch of criminals.

321
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:46,780
The truth is, it's not just us at the
returnee school they're suspicious of.

322
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:50,320
It's all VR MMO players.

323
00:20:50,620 --> 00:20:53,091
They think we're all a bunch of deadbeats.

324
00:20:53,940 --> 00:20:56,060
Losers dragging society down.

325
00:20:57,380 --> 00:21:00,380
Cowards who don't pay taxes
and can't face reality.

326
00:21:00,900 --> 00:21:04,177
People are saying we need
the draft back to force

327
00:21:04,260 --> 00:21:06,757
us to enlist because at
least we can be useful there.

328
00:21:06,840 --> 00:21:10,257
And even though they think that
about us, you know what I believe?

329
00:21:10,340 --> 00:21:13,780
That this here, this is reality.

330
00:21:16,740 --> 00:21:20,217
This world and all the
other virtual worlds

331
00:21:20,300 --> 00:21:23,577
connected to it they're
real they're not just

332
00:21:23,660 --> 00:21:28,377
Games we play here in VR
I have a real life and

333
00:21:28,460 --> 00:21:31,697
I have real friends I
laugh and I cry and I feel

334
00:21:31,780 --> 00:21:35,317
Real feelings the same
as offline isn't it like

335
00:21:35,400 --> 00:21:37,997
that for you we pour our
hearts and souls into

336
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:40,137
This world because it's
different from what we

337
00:21:40,220 --> 00:21:43,900
got out there but if it's
all just a stupid game

338
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:46,557
Everything we've been
through and felt here is

339
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:51,680
fake if so then in the
end what is real for us

340
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:57,257
All the worlds we've grown fused together

341
00:21:57,340 --> 00:22:00,240
they're as thick and
tall as the world tree

342
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:07,780
And from them from them the underworld
started to bloom I want to protect it

343
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:10,100
So please,

344
00:22:10,460 --> 00:22:14,460
please, help us.

345
00:22:51,560 --> 00:22:52,460
Don't stop!

346
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:53,680
Cut the next one!

347
00:23:08,080 --> 00:23:10,000
Thank you.

348
00:23:21,500 --> 00:23:22,777
We'll see

349
00:23:22,860 --> 00:23:23,690
you

350
00:23:23,773 --> 00:23:30,760
next

351
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:37,357
time on the next

352
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:39,322
episode of The One-Sundi-Hikari.

353
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:40,156
Thank you.
